              text: 'The Brandalism collective, formed in 2012, exemplifies this dual approach. Their physical interventions in advertising spaces are meticulously documented and shared online, creating a much larger audience than would witness the alterations in person. Their 2015 intervention during the COP21 climate conference in Paris—where they installed 600 unauthorized posters critiquing corporate greenwashing—gained global media attention through digital channels.',
