              text: "Adbusters' approach demonstrates how subvertising can evolve from isolated interventions into a broader social movement with its own media platforms, campaigns, and networks. Their work has been particularly influential in linking advertising critique to broader questions about economic systems, environmental sustainability, and psychological well-being.",
