              text: 'Financial support for subvertising-related work comes through a diverse array of channels, ranging from conventional arts funding organizations to cutting-edge, innovative crowdfunding approaches that harness the power of community engagement. It is essential to carefully consider not only the myriad opportunities these funding avenues present but also the potential constraints associated with each distinct source of funding. By weighing the advantages against the limitations, one can navigate the complex landscape of financial support more effectively.',
